/Title (A many-to-many \(M:N\) relationship exists between Purchase and Medicine \(CONTAINS\), where each purchase can include multiple medicines, and each medicine can appear in multiple purchases. This relationship is implemented using an associative entity called Purchase_Details, which includes attributes such as quantity and subtotal, representing the number of units and the cost of each medicine within a specific purchase.)
